nic":"Reis (米) wird mit dem Schöpflöffel (斗) abgemessen – das Material und die Gebühr dafür.","examples":[{"w":"料","r":"りょう","m":"Gebühr, Entgelt"},{"w":"飲料","r":"いんりょう","m":"Getränk"},{"w":"試料","r":"しりょう","m":"Probe, Muster"}]},{"c":"工","meanings":["Handwerk","Bau","Arbeit"],"on":["コウ","ク","グ"],"kun":[],"mnemonic":"Ein Balken zwischen zwei Querlatten, wie ein Werkzeug des Zimmermanns – Handwerk und Bau.","examples":[{"w":"起工","r":"きこう","m":"Arbeitsbeginn"},{"w":"工員","r":"こういん","m":"Fabrikarbeiter"},{"w":"工学","r":"こうがく","m":"Ingenieurwesen, Technik"}]},{"c":"建","meanings":["bauen","errichten"],"on":["ケン","コン"],"kun":["た.てる","た.て","-だ.て","た.つ"],"mnemonic":"Mit dem Pinsel (聿) wird der Plan gezeichnet, dann geht es (廴) los – man baut und errichtet das Haus.","examples":[{"w":"建つ","r":"たつ","m":"errichtet werden, stehen"},{"w":"建てる","r":"たてる","m":"bauen, errichten"},{"w":"建国","r":"けんこく","m":"Staatsgründung"}]},{"c":"急","meanings":["eilig","plötzlich","dringend"],"on":["キュウ"],"kun":["いそ.ぐ","いそ.ぎ","せ.く"],"mnemonic":"Wenn das Herz (心) rast und man hinterherjagt, ist es eilig – ein plötzlicher Notfall.","examples":[{"w":"急ぎ","r":"いそぎ","m":"Eile"},{"w":"急ぐ","r":"いそぐ","m":"sich beeilen"},{"w":"急に","r":"きゅうに","m":"plötzlich, rasch"}]},{"c":"止","meanings":["anhalten","stoppen"],"on":["シ"],"kun":["と.まる","-ど.まり","と.める","-と.める","-ど.め","とど.める","とど.め","とど.まる","や.める","や.む","-や.む","よ.す","-さ.す","-さ.し"],"mnemonic":"Ein Fuß bleibt stehen, die Zehen zeigen nach vorn – man hält an und stoppt.","examples":[{"w":"止す","r":"よす","m":"aufhören, unterlassen"},{"w":"止む","r":"やむ","m":"aufhören, enden"},{"w":"止まる","r":"とまる","m":"anhalten, stehen bleiben"}]},{"c":"送","meanings":["senden","schicken","begleiten"],"on":["ソウ"],"kun":["おく.る"],"mnemonic":"Man geht (⻌) mit dem Gast ein Stück mit und schickt ihn auf den Weg – senden und verabschieden.","examples":[{"w":"送り","r":"おくり","m":"Verabschiedung, Begleitung"},{"w":"送る","r":"おくる","m":"schicken, senden"},{"w":"送金","r":"そうきん","m":"Geldüberweisung"}]},{"c":"切","meanings":["schneiden","abschneiden"],"on":["セツ","サイ"],"kun":["き.る","-き.る","き.り","-き.り","-ぎ.り","き.れる","-き.れる","き.れ","-き.れ","-ぎ.れ"],"mnemonic":"Das Messer (刀) trifft die Sieben (七), die in der Mitte entzweigeht – es schneidet glatt durch.","examples":[{"w":"切り","r":"きり","m":"Ende, Schluss"},{"w":"切る","r":"きる","m":"schneiden, durchschneiden"},{"w":"切れ","r":"きれ","m":"Stück, Scheibe"}]},{"c":"転","meanings":["rollen","sich drehen","stürzen"],"on":["テン"],"kun":["ころ.がる","ころ.げる","ころ.がす","ころ.ぶ","まろ.ぶ","うたた","うつ.る","くる.めく"],"mnemonic":"Ein Wagen (車) dreht sich und rollt davon, als würde er wie eine Wolke (云) wirbeln – er rollt und kippt um.","examples":[{"w":"転ぶ","r":"ころぶ","m":"hinfallen, stürzen"},{"w":"転々","r":"てんてん","m":"von Ort zu Ort wechseln"},{"w":"転がす","r":"ころがす","m":"rollen, wälzen"}]},{"c":"研","meanings":["schleifen","erforschen"],"on":["ケン"],"kun":["と.ぐ"],"mnemonic":"Ein Stein (石) wird flach gerieben (开), bis er blank ist – man schleift ihn und erforscht seine Oberfläche.","examples":[{"w":"研ぐ","r":"とぐ","m":"schärfen, wetzen"},{"w":"研究","r":"けんきゅう","m":"Forschung, Studium"},{"w":"研究員","r":"けんきゅういん","m":"Forscher, Laborangestellter"}]},{"c":"究","meanings":["erforschen","ergründen"],"on":["キュウ","ク"],"kun":["きわ.める"],"mnemonic":"Tief in einer Höhle (穴) greift die neunfache (九) Neugier nach der Wahrheit – man ergründet alles gründlich.","examples":[{"w":"学究","r":"がっきゅう","m":"Gelehrter, Wissenschaftler"},{"w":"究明","r":"きゅうめい","m":"Aufklärung, Ergründung"},{"w":"研究","r":"けんきゅう","m":"Forschung, Studium"}]},{"c":"楽","meanings":["Musik","Freude","bequem"],"on":["ガク","ラク","ゴウ"],"kun":["たの.しい","たの.しむ","この.む"],"mnemonic":"Ein Baum (木) mit Trommeln und Glocken, daran erklingt Musik – das macht Freude.","examples":[{"w":"楽","r":"らく","m":"Bequemlichkeit, Leichtigkeit"},{"w":"楽しい","r":"たのしい","m":"erfreulich, lustig"},{"w":"楽しみ","r":"たのしみ","m":"Vergnügen, Freude"}]},{"c":"起","meanings":["aufstehen","sich erheben"],"on":["キ"],"kun":["お.きる","お.こる","お.こす","おこ.す","た.つ"],"mnemonic":"Man läuft (走) los, sobald man sich selbst (己) aus dem Bett erhebt – aufstehen und in Bewegung kommen.","examples":[{"w":"起きる","r":"おきる","m":"aufstehen, sich erheben"},{"w":"起こす","r":"おこす","m":"aufwecken, hervorrufen"},{"w":"起こる","r":"おこる","m":"geschehen, passieren"}]},{"c":"着","meanings":["ankommen","anziehen","tragen"],"on":["チャク","ジャク"],"kun":["き.る","-ぎ","き.せる","-き.せ","つ.く","つ.ける"],"mnemonic":"Das Auge (目) sieht die Kleidung am Körper sitzen, daneben kommt jemand an – man zieht etwas an und trifft ein.","examples":[{"w":"着く","r":"つく","m":"ankommen, eintreffen"},{"w":"着る","r":"きる","m":"anziehen, tragen"},{"w":"着々","r":"ちゃくちゃく","m":"stetig, Schritt für Schritt"}]},{"c":"病","meanings":["Krankheit","krank"],"on":["ビョウ","ヘイ"],"kun":["や.む","-や.み","やまい"],"mnemonic":"Ein Krankenbett-Dach (疒) schützt den Kranken – wer darunter liegt, hat eine Krankheit und ist krank.","examples":[{"w":"病む","r":"やむ","m":"erkranken"},{"w":"病","r":"やまい","m":"Krankheit"},{"w":"うつ病","r":"うつびょう","m":"Depression"}]},{"c":"質","meanings":["Qualität","Beschaffenheit"],"on":["シツ","シチ","チ"],"kun":["たち","ただ.す","もと","わりふ"],"mnemonic":"Wer für etwas Geld (貝) hinlegt, prüft zuerst genau seine Qualität und Beschaffenheit.","examples":[{"w":"質","r":"しつ","m":"Qualität, Wert"},{"w":"悪質","r":"あくしつ","m":"bösartig, minderwertig"},{"w":"音質","r":"おんしつ","m":"Klangqualität"}]},{"c":"待","meanings":["warten"],"on":["タイ"],"kun":["ま.つ","-ま.ち"],"mnemonic":"Man steht auf dem Weg (彳) vor dem Tempel (寺) und wartet geduldig auf Einlass.","examples":[{"w":"待つ","r":"まつ","m":"warten"},{"w":"待ち","r":"まち","m":"Warten, Wartezeit"},{"w":"待たす","r":"またす","m":"jemanden warten lassen"}]},{"c":"試","meanings":["versuchen","testen","Prüfung"],"on":["シ"],"kun":["こころ.みる","ため.す"],"mnemonic":"Mit Worten (言) und nach einem Muster (式) wird etwas ausprobiert – man testet und versucht es.","examples":[{"w":"試し","r":"ためし","m":"Versuch, Probe"},{"w":"試す","r":"ためす","m":"ausprobieren, versuchen"},{"w":"試み","r":"こころみ","m":"Versuch, Probe"}]},{"c":"族","meanings":["Familie","Stamm","Sippe"],"on":["ゾク"],"kun":[],"mnemonic":"Unter der Fahne (方) versammeln sich die Pfeile und Mitglieder – ein Stamm, eine Sippe, eine Familie.","examples":[{"w":"族","r":"ぞく","m":"Stamm, Volk"},{"w":"一族","r":"いちぞく","m":"Sippe, Verwandtschaft"},{"w":"家族","r":"かぞく","m":"Familie"}]},{"c":"銀","meanings":["Silber"],"on":["ギン"],"kun":["しろがね"],"mnemonic":"Ein Metall (金), das vor lauter Glanz fast stehen bleibt (艮) – es ist weiß und strahlend: Silber.","examples":[{"w":"銀","r":"ぎん","m":"Silber (Ag)"},{"w":"銀行","r":"ぎんこう","m":"Bank, Geldinstitut"},{"w":"銀紙","r":"ぎんがみ","m":"Alufolie"}]},{"c":"早","meanings":["früh","schnell"],"on":["ソウ","サッ"],"kun":["はや.い","はや","はや-","はや.まる","はや.める","さ-"],"mnemonic":"Die Sonne (日) steht noch über dem Zehnerstrich (十), kaum hoch am Himmel – es ist früh.","examples":[{"w":"早く","r":"はやく","m":"früh, bald"},{"w":"早い","r":"はやい","m":"schnell, rasch"},{"w":"早々","r":"そうそう","m":"sobald, gleich nach"}]},{"c":"映","meanings":["sich spiegeln","zeigen","Widerschein"],"on":["エイ"],"kun":["うつ.る","うつ.す","は.える","-ば.え"],"mnemonic":"Die Sonne (日) steht in der Mitte (央) – ihr Licht spiegelt sich im Wasser und wirft ein Bild.","examples":[{"w":"映る","r":"うつる","m":"sich spiegeln, erscheinen"},{"w":"映す","r":"うつす","m":"zeigen, projizieren, spiegeln"},{"w":"映える","r":"はえる","m":"glänzen, strahlen"}]},{"c":"親","meanings":["Eltern","vertraut"],"on":["シン"],"kun":["おや","おや-","した.しい","した.しむ"],"mnemonic":"Eltern sehen (見) ständig nach ihrem Kind – sie sind einem am vertrautesten.","examples":[{"w":"親","r":"おや","m":"Eltern, Elternteil"},{"w":"親しい","r":"したしい","m":"vertraut, eng"},{"w":"親しむ","r":"したしむ","m":"sich anfreunden, vertraut sein"}]},{"c":"験","meanings":["Prüfung","Erfahrung"],"on":["ケン","ゲン"],"kun":["あかし","しるし","ため.す","ためし"],"mnemonic":"Ein Pferd (馬) wird gründlich getestet, bevor man ihm vertraut – eine Prüfung, aus der man Erfahrung gewinnt.","examples":[{"w":"試験","r":"しけん","m":"Prüfung, Examen"},{"w":"体験","r":"たいけん","m":"Erfahrung, Erlebnis"},{"w":"試験場","r":"しけんじょう","m":"Prüfungsraum, Prüfungssaal"}]},{"c":"英","meanings":["England","englisch","Held"],"on":["エイ"],"kun":["はなぶさ"],"mnemonic":"Eine Blume (艹) blüht in der Mitte (央) – die Schönste des Landes: England, auch Held.","examples":[{"w":"英","r":"えい","m":"Vereinigtes Königreich, Großbritannien"},{"w":"英気","r":"えいき","m":"scharfer Verstand"},{"w":"英語","r":"えいご","m":"Englisch (Sprache)"}]},{"c":"医","meanings":["Arzt","Medizin"],"on":["イ"],"kun":["い.やす","い.する","くすし"],"mnemonic":"Ein Pfeil (矢) in einer Truhe (匸): Der Arzt hat seine Instrumente verstaut und heilt damit.","examples":[{"w":"医","r":"い","m":"Medizin, Heilkunst"},{"w":"医院","r":"いいん","m":"Arztpraxis, Klinik"},{"w":"医学","r":"いがく","m":"Medizin, Heilkunde"}]},{"c":"仕","meanings":["dienen","arbeiten"],"on":["シ","ジ"],"kun":["つか.える"],"mnemonic":"Ein Mensch (亻) steht als Gelehrter (士) im Dienst – er dient und arbeitet für einen Herrn.","examples":[{"w":"仕える","r":"つかえる","m":"dienen, jemandem dienen"},{"w":"仕業","r":"しわざ","m":"Tat, Machenschaft"},{"w":"仕事","r":"しごと","m":"Arbeit, Beruf"}]},{"c":"去","meanings":["weggehen","vergangen"],"on":["キョ","コ"],"kun":["さ.る","-さ.る"],"mnemonic":"Erde (土) bleibt zurück, während jemand sich (厶) entfernt – er geht weg, es ist vergangen.","examples":[{"w":"去る","r":"さる","m":"verlassen, weggehen"},{"w":"去年","r":"きょねん","m":"letztes Jahr"},{"w":"去来","r":"きょらい","m":"Kommen und Gehen"}]},{"c":"味","meanings":["Geschmack"],"on":["ミ"],"kun":["あじ","あじ.わう"],"mnemonic":"Mit dem Mund (口) prüft man, wie weit etwas noch nicht (未) ausgereift ist – das ist der Geschmack.","examples":[{"w":"味","r":"あじ","m":"Geschmack, Aroma"},{"w":"味わい","r":"あじわい","m":"Geschmack, Aroma"},{"w":"味わう","r":"あじわう","m":"schmecken, auskosten"}]},{"c":"写","meanings":["kopieren","abbilden","fotografieren"],"on":["シャ","ジャ"],"kun":["うつ.す","うつ.る","うつ-","うつ.し"],"mnemonic":"Unter einer Decke (冖) wird alles Stück für Stück abgebildet – man kopiert und fotografiert.","examples":[{"w":"写し","r":"うつし","m":"Kopie, Abschrift"},{"w":"写る","r":"うつる","m":"fotografiert werden, durchscheinen"},{"w":"写す","r":"うつす","m":"kopieren, abschreiben"}]},{"c":"字","meanings":["Schriftzeichen","Buchstabe"],"on":["ジ"],"kun":["あざ","あざな","-な"],"mnemonic":"Ein Kind (子) unter dem Dach (宀) lernt fleißig seine Schriftzeichen und Buchstaben.","examples":[{"w":"字","r":"あざ","m":"Dorfabschnitt, Flur"},{"w":"一字","r":"いちじ","m":"ein Zeichen, ein Buchstabe"},{"w":"英字","r":"えいじ","m":"lateinischer Buchstabe"}]},{"c":"答","meanings":["Antwort","antworten"],"on":["トウ"],"kun":["こた.える","こた.え"],"mnemonic":"Bambus (竹) wird passend (合) zusammengefügt wie Frage und Antwort – so antwortet man.","examples":[{"w":"答え","r":"こたえ","m":"Antwort"},{"w":"答える","r":"こたえる","m":"antworten, erwidern"},{"w":"問答","r":"もんどう","m":"Frage und Antwort, Dialog"}]},{"c":"夜","meanings":["Nacht","Abend"],"on":["ヤ"],"kun":["よ","よる"],"mnemonic":"Unter dem Dach (亠) kommt die Dunkelheit, und der Mond steht am Himmel – es ist Nacht.","examples":[{"w":"夜","r":"よる","m":"Nacht, Abend"},{"w":"月夜","r":"つきよ","m":"mondhelle Nacht"},{"w":"今夜","r":"こんや","m":"heute Abend"}]},{"c":"音","meanings":["Klang","Geräusch","Ton"],"on":["オン","イン"],"kun":["おと","ね"],"mnemonic":"Man steht (立) da und hört in der Sonne (日) einen Ton – ein Klang, ein Geräusch.","examples":[{"w":"音","r":"おと","m":"Klang, Geräusch"},{"w":"音楽","r":"おんがく","m":"Musik"},{"w":"音質","r":"おんしつ","m":"Klangqualität"}]},{"c":"注","meanings":["gießen","eingießen"],"on":["チュウ"],"kun":["そそ.ぐ","さ.す","つ.ぐ"],"mnemonic":"Wasser (氵) wird vom Hausherrn (主) bedächtig eingegossen – so gießt man hinein.","examples":[{"w":"注ぐ","r":"そそぐ","m":"gießen, einschenken"},{"w":"注す","r":"さす","m":"eingießen, hinzufügen"},{"w":"注","r":"ちゅう","m":"Anmerkung, Fußnote"}]},{"c":"帰","meanings":["heimkehren","zurückkehren"],"on":["キ"],"kun":["かえ.る","かえ.す","おく.る","とつ.ぐ"],"mnemonic":"Mit dem Besen (帚) wird noch einmal gekehrt, dann geht es heim – man kehrt zurück.","examples":[{"w":"帰す","r":"かえす","m":"heimschicken, zurückschicken"},{"w":"帰り","r":"かえり","m":"Rückkehr, Heimweg"},{"w":"帰る","r":"かえる","m":"zurückkehren, heimkommen"}]},{"c":"歌","meanings":["Lied","singen"],"on":["カ"],"kun":["うた","うた.う"],"mnemonic":"Mit weit geöffnetem Mund (欠) schmettert man ein Lied – man singt aus voller Kehle.","examples":[{"w":"歌う","r":"うたう","m":"singen"},{"w":"歌","r":"うた","m":"Lied, Gesang"},{"w":"歌手","r":"かしゅ","m":"Sänger, Sängerin"}]},{"c":"悪","meanings":["schlecht","böse"],"on":["アク","オ"],"kun":["わる.い","わる-","あ.し","にく.い","-にく.い","ああ","いずくに","いずくんぞ","にく.む"],"mnemonic":"Ein verwinkeltes Haus (亜) und ein bedrücktes Herz (心) – das ist schlecht und fühlt sich böse an.","examples":[{"w":"悪い","r":"わるい","m":"schlecht, mies"},{"w":"悪さ","r":"わるさ","m":"Schlechtigkeit, Unfug"},{"w":"悪","r":"あく","m":"das Böse, Übel"}]},{"c":"図","meanings":["Zeichnung","Plan","Karte"],"on":["ズ","ト"],"kun":["え","はか.る"],"mnemonic":"Ein Rahmen (囗), in den man etwas einträgt (乂) – eine Zeichnung, ein Plan oder eine Karte.","examples":[{"w":"図る","r":"はかる","m":"planen, versuchen"},{"w":"図","r":"ず","m":"Zeichnung, Bild"},{"w":"意図","r":"いと","m":"Absicht, Vorhaben"}]},{"c":"室","meanings":["Zimmer","Raum"],"on":["シツ"],"kun":["むろ"],"mnemonic":"Unter dem Dach (宀) kommt man an (至) – man betritt sein Zimmer.","examples":[{"w":"室","r":"しつ","m":"Zimmer, Raum"},{"w":"一室","r":"いっしつ","m":"ein Zimmer"},{"w":"教室","r":"きょうしつ","m":"Klassenzimmer"}]},{"c":"歩","meanings":["gehen","zu Fuß gehen","Schritt"],"on":["ホ","ブ","フ"],"kun":["ある.く","あゆ.む"],"mnemonic":"Ein Fuß (止) tritt auf, der nächste folgt – so geht man Schritt für Schritt.","examples":[{"w":"歩く","r":"あるく","m":"gehen, zu Fuß gehen"},{"w":"歩み","r":"あゆみ","m":"Gang, Schritt"},{"w":"歩む","r":"あゆむ","m":"gehen, wandeln"}]},{"c":"風","meanings":["Wind","Stil"],"on":["フウ","フ"],"kun":["かぜ","かざ-","-かぜ"],"mnemonic":"Das Zeichen zeigt ein Segel (几), das der Wind aufbläht – der Wind weht.","examples":[{"w":"そよ風","r":"そよかぜ","m":"sanfte Brise, leichter Wind"},{"w":"風","r":"かぜ","m":"Wind, Brise"},{"w":"一風","r":"いっぷう","m":"Eigenart, Sonderbarkeit"}]},{"c":"紙","meanings":["Papier"],"on":["シ"],"kun":["かみ"],"mnemonic":"Aus Fasern (糸) formt man eine flache Fläche (氏) – so entsteht Papier.","examples":[{"w":"紙","r":"かみ","m":"Papier"},{"w":"ちり紙","r":"ちりがみ","m":"Papiertaschentuch, Toilettenpapier"},{"w":"銀紙","r":"ぎんがみ","m":"Alufolie"}]},{"c":"黒","meanings":["schwarz"],"on":["コク"],"kun":["くろ","くろ.ずむ","くろ.い"],"mnemonic":"Über dem Dorf (里) brennt ein Feuer (灬), und der Ruß färbt alles schwarz.","examples":[{"w":"黒い","r":"くろい","m":"schwarz"},{"w":"黒","r":"くろ","m":"Schwarz"},{"w":"黒海","r":"こっかい","m":"Schwarzes Meer"}]},{"c":"春","meanings":["Frühling"],"on":["シュン"],"kun":["はる"],"mnemonic":"Die Sonne (日) wärmt, und die Pflanzen sprießen kräftig – der Frühling erwacht.","examples":[{"w":"春","r":"はる","m":"Frühling"},{"w":"今春","r":"こんしゅん","m":"dieser Frühling"},{"w":"春秋","r":"しゅんじゅう","m":"Frühling und Herbst"}]},{"c":"赤","meanings":["rot"],"on":["セキ","シャク"],"kun":["あか","あか-","あか.い","あか.らむ","あか.らめる"],"mnemonic":"Auf der Erde (土) glüht ein Feuer und färbt alles rot.","examples":[{"w":"赤い","r":"あかい","m":"rot, purpurrot"},{"w":"赤","r":"あか","m":"Rot"},{"w":"赤字","r":"あかじ","m":"rote Zahlen, Defizit"}]},{"c":"青","meanings":["blau","grün"],"on":["セイ","ショウ"],"kun":["あお","あお-","あお.い"],"mnemonic":"Wie junges Gras und der Mond (月) im frischen Morgen: Himmel und Laub leuchten blau und grün.","examples":[{"w":"青い","r":"あおい","m":"blau, azurblau"},{"w":"青","r":"あお","m":"Blau"},{"w":"青空","r":"あおぞら","m":"blauer Himmel"}]},{"c":"館","meanings":["Gebäude","Halle"],"on":["カン"],"kun":["やかた","たて"],"mnemonic":"Wo man isst (飠) und die Beamten (官) wohnen, steht ein großes Gebäude oder eine Halle.","examples":[{"w":"開館","r":"かいかん","m":"Eröffnung (von Bibliothek, Museum)"},{"w":"館長","r":"かんちょう","m":"Leiter, Direktor (eines Hauses)"},{"w":"公館","r":"こうかん","m":"Amtssitz, Dienstwohnung"}]},{"c":"屋","meanings":["Haus","Laden","Dach"],"on":["オク"],"kun":["や"],"mnemonic":"Ein Dach (尸) über dem Ort, an dem man ankommt (至) – das Haus, in dem man bleibt, oder der Laden.","examples":[{"w":"パン屋","r":"パンや","m":"Bäckerei, Bäcker"},{"w":"屋外","r":"おくがい","m":"draußen, im Freien"},{"w":"屋上","r":"おくじょう","m":"Dach, Dachterrasse"}]},{"c":"色","meanings":["Farbe"],"on":["ショク","シキ"],"kun":["いろ"],"mnemonic":"Wenn man sich schämt, schießt einem die Farbe ins Gesicht – das Zeichen steht für Farbe.","examples":[{"w":"色々","r":"いろいろ","m":"verschiedene, allerlei"},{"w":"色","r":"いろ","m":"Farbe"},{"w":"バラ色","r":"バラいろ","m":"Rosa, rosenfarben"}]},{"c":"走","meanings":["laufen","rennen"],"on":["ソウ"],"kun":["はし.る"],"mnemonic":"Ein Mensch auf der Erde (土) bewegt die Füße rasch hintereinander – er läuft und rennt.","examples":[{"w":"走り","r":"はしり","m":"Lauf, Laufen"},{"w":"走る","r":"はしる","m":"laufen, rennen"},{"w":"走行","r":"そうこう","m":"Fahren (eines Fahrzeugs)"}]},{"c":"秋","meanings":["Herbst"],"on":["シュウ"],"kun":["あき","とき"],"mnemonic":"Das Getreide (禾) leuchtet wie Feuer (火) in Gelb und Rot – es ist Herbst.","examples":[{"w":"秋","r":"あき","m":"Herbst"},{"w":"今秋","r":"こんしゅう","m":"dieser Herbst"},{"w":"秋口","r":"あきぐち","m":"Herbstanfang"}]},{"c":"夏","meanings":["Sommer"],"on":["カ","ガ","ゲ"],"kun":["なつ"],"mnemonic":"Im Sommer schleppt man sich mit müden Füßen (夂) durch die Hitze – ein heißer, drückender Sommer.","examples":[{"w":"夏","r":"なつ","m":"Sommer"},{"w":"夏バテ","r":"なつばて","m":"Sommermüdigkeit"},{"w":"夏場","r":"なつば","m":"Sommerzeit"}]},{"c":"習","meanings":["lernen","üben"],"on":["シュウ","ジュ"],"kun":["なら.う","なら.い"],"mnemonic":"Ein junger Vogel übt mit den Flügeln (羽) vor einem hellen (白) Himmel das Fliegen – so lernt man durch Üben.","examples":[{"w":"習う","r":"ならう","m":"Unterricht nehmen, lernen"},{"w":"学習","r":"がくしゅう","m":"Lernen, Studium"},{"w":"教習","r":"きょうしゅう","m":"Ausbildung, Schulung"}]},{"c":"洋","meanings":["Ozean","Meer","westlich"],"on":["ヨウ"],"kun":[],"mnemonic":"Wasser (氵) so weit wie eine Schafherde (羊) auf einer Weide – der weite Ozean, von dem der Westen kommt.","examples":[{"w":"海洋","r":"かいよう","m":"Ozean, Meer"},{"w":"西洋","r":"せいよう","m":"der Westen, Abendland"},{"w":"東洋","r":"とうよう","m":"der Osten, Orient"}]},{"c":"旅","meanings":["Reise","reisen"],"on":["リョ"],"kun":["たび"],"mnemonic":"Unter einer wehenden Fahne (方) ziehen die Leute los – eine Reise beginnt.","examples":[{"w":"旅","r":"たび","m":"Reise"},{"w":"旅館","r":"りょかん","m":"Ryokan, japanischer Gasthof"},{"w":"旅行","r":"りょこう","m":"Reise, Fahrt"}]},{"c":"服","meanings":["Kleidung","Kleider"],"on":["フク"],"kun":[],"mnemonic":"Ein weicher Stoff, der sich dem Körper anpasst wie der Mond (月) dem Himmel – Kleidung, die man trägt.","examples":[{"w":"服","r":"ふく","m":"Kleidung"},{"w":"着服","r":"ちゃくふく","m":"Unterschlagung"},{"w":"不服","r":"ふふく","m":"Unzufriedenheit"}]},{"c":"夕","meanings":["Abend"],"on":["セキ"],"kun":["ゆう"],"mnemonic":"Ein Halbmond am Himmel, der sich zeigt, wenn der Tag zu Ende geht – der Abend.","examples":[{"w":"夕","r":"ゆう","m":"Abend"},{"w":"朝夕","r":"あさゆう","m":"Morgen und Abend"},{"w":"夕食","r":"ゆうしょく","m":"Abendessen"}]},{"c":"借","meanings":["leihen","borgen","mieten"],"on":["シャク"],"kun":["か.りる"],"mnemonic":"Ein Mensch (亻) bittet um etwas aus alter Zeit (昔) – er leiht es sich und borgt.","examples":[{"w":"借り","r":"かり","m":"Borgen, Schuld"},{"w":"借りる","r":"かりる","m":"leihen, borgen"},{"w":"借金","r":"しゃっきん","m":"Schulden"}]},{"c":"肉","meanings":["Fleisch"],"on":["ニク"],"kun":["しし"],"mnemonic":"Das Zeichen zeigt ein Stück Fleisch mit seinen Fasern – das Fleisch, das man isst.","examples":[{"w":"肉","r":"にく","m":"Fleisch"},{"w":"肉まん","r":"にくまん","m":"Maultasche mit Fleischfüllung"},{"w":"牛肉","r":"ぎゅうにく","m":"Rindfleisch"}]},{"c":"貸","meanings":["verleihen","leihen"],"on":["タイ"],"kun":["か.す","か.し-","かし-"],"mnemonic":"Man überlässt einem anderen (代) Geld (貝) auf Zeit – man verleiht und stellt es zur Verfügung.","examples":[{"w":"貸し","r":"かし","m":"Verleih, Darlehen"},{"w":"貸す","r":"かす","m":"verleihen, ausleihen"},{"w":"貸家","r":"かしや","m":"Mietshaus"}]},{"c":"堂","meanings":["Halle","Saal"],"on":["ドウ"],"kun":[],"mnemonic":"Auf festem Boden (土) erhebt sich ein erhabener (尚) Bau – eine große Halle.","examples":[{"w":"堂々","r":"どうどう","m":"prächtig, stattlich"},{"w":"堂","r":"どう","m":"Tempel, Halle"},{"w":"一堂","r":"いちどう","m":"ein Gebäude, die Versammlung"}]},{"c":"鳥","meanings":["Vogel"],"on":["チョウ"],"kun":["とり"],"mnemonic":"Ein Vogel mit Kopf, Auge, Schnabel und Schwanz – an den Beinen (灬) erkennt man ihn.","examples":[{"w":"鳥","r":"とり","m":"Vogel"},{"w":"花鳥","r":"かちょう","m":"Blumen und Vögel"},{"w":"小鳥","r":"ことり","m":"kleiner Vogel"}]},{"c":"飯","meanings":["Reis","Mahlzeit"],"on":["ハン"],"kun":["めし"],"mnemonic":"Wer essen (飠) will, muss dem Reis die Rückseite (反) wenden – gekochter Reis, eine Mahlzeit.","examples":[{"w":"ご飯","r":"ごはん","m":"gekochter Reis, Mahlzeit"},{"w":"飯","r":"めし","m":"gekochter Reis"},{"w":"赤飯","r":"せきはん","m":"roter Reis (Festtagsgericht)"}]},{"c":"勉","meanings":["sich anstrengen","lernen"],"on":["ベン"],"kun":["つと.める"],"mnemonic":"Wer sich nicht (免) drücken will, setzt seine Kraft (力) ein – er strengt sich an und lernt.","examples":[{"w":"勉学","r":"べんがく","m":"Studium, Lernen"},{"w":"勉強","r":"べんきょう","m":"lernen, studieren"},{"w":"勉強中","r":"べんきょうちゅう","m":"beim Lernen"}]},{"c":"冬","meanings":["Winter"],"on":["トウ"],"kun":["ふゆ"],"mnemonic":"Mit schleppenden Füßen (夂) geht es durch Eis (冫) und Kälte – der Winter.","examples":[{"w":"冬","r":"ふゆ","m":"Winter"},{"w":"真冬","r":"まふゆ","m":"tiefster Winter"},{"w":"冬物","r":"ふゆもの","m":"Winterkleidung"}]},{"c":"昼","meanings":["Mittag","Tag"],"on":["チュウ"],"kun":["ひる"],"mnemonic":"Ein Lineal (尺) zeigt die Sonne am höchsten Punkt (旦) – es ist Mittag, der helle Tag.","examples":[{"w":"お昼","r":"おひる","m":"Mittagessen"},{"w":"昼","r":"ひる","m":"Mittag, Tag"},{"w":"昼前","r":"ひるまえ","m":"Vormittag"}]},{"c":"茶","meanings":["Tee"],"on":["チャ","サ"],"kun":[],"mnemonic":"Blätter und Gräser (艹) werden aufgegossen – das Getränk ist Tee.","examples":[{"w":"お茶","r":"おちゃ","m":"Tee"},{"w":"茶","r":"ちゃ","m":"Tee"},{"w":"茶屋","r":"ちゃや","m":"Teehaus, Raststätte"}]},{"c":"弟","meanings":["jüngerer Bruder","Bruder"],"on":["テイ","ダイ","デ"],"kun":["おとうと"],"mnemonic":"Wie bei einer Treppe (八) kommt der Jüngere hinterher – der kleine Bruder folgt dem großen.","examples":[{"w":"弟","r":"おとうと","m":"jüngerer Bruder"},{"w":"兄弟","r":"きょうだい","m":"Geschwister (Brüder und Schwestern)"},{"w":"子弟","r":"してい","m":"Söhne, Kinder"}]},{"c":"牛","meanings":["Rind","Kuh"],"on":["ギュウ"],"kun":["うし"],"mnemonic":"Der Kopf eines Rindes mit zwei Hörnern, von vorn gesehen – eine Kuh.","examples":[{"w":"牛","r":"うし","m":"Rind, Kuh"},{"w":"牛肉","r":"ぎゅうにく","m":"Rindfleisch"},{"w":"水牛","r":"すいぎゅう","m":"Wasserbüffel"}]},{"c":"兄","meanings":["älterer Bruder","Bruder"],"on":["ケイ","キョウ"],"kun":["あに"],"mnemonic":"Der Ältere mit dem großen Mund (口) auf kräftigen Beinen (儿) führt das Wort – der große Bruder.","examples":[{"w":"兄","r":"あに","m":"älterer Bruder"},{"w":"兄さん","r":"にいさん","m":"älterer Bruder (Anrede)"},{"w":"兄弟","r":"きょうだい","m":"Geschwister"}]},{"c":"犬","meanings":["Hund"],"on":["ケン"],"kun":["いぬ","いぬ-"],"mnemonic":"Ein großer (大) Kerl mit Ohr (丶) – ein Hund mit gespitzten Ohren.","examples":[{"w":"犬","r":"いぬ","m":"Hund"},{"w":"野犬","r":"やけん","m":"streunender Hund"},{"w":"子犬","r":"こいぬ","m":"Welpe"}]},{"c":"妹","meanings":["jüngere Schwester","Schwester"],"on":["マイ"],"kun":["いもうと"],"mnemonic":"Eine Frau (女), die noch nicht (未) ganz erwachsen ist – die kleine Schwester.","examples":[{"w":"妹","r":"いもうと","m":"jüngere Schwester"},{"w":"弟妹","r":"ていまい","m":"jüngere Geschwister"},{"w":"姉妹","r":"しまい","m":"Schwestern"}]},{"c":"姉","meanings":["ältere Schwester","Schwester"],"on":["シ"],"kun":["あね","はは"],"mnemonic":"Eine Frau (女), die im Markt (市) zu Hause ist und alles kennt – die große Schwester.","examples":[{"w":"姉","r":"あね","m":"ältere Schwester"},{"w":"姉さん","r":"ねえさん","m":"ältere Schwester (Anrede)"},{"w":"姉妹","r":"しまい","m":"Schwestern"}]},{"c":"漢","meanings":["China","chinesisch"],"on":["カン"],"kun":[],"mnemonic":"Wasser (氵) am großen Fluss in China – hier stammen die Han-Chinesen und die chinesischen Schriftzeichen her.","examples":[{"w":"漢語","r":"かんご","m":"Wort chinesischen Ursprungs"},{"w":"漢字","r":"かんじ","m":"Kanji, chinesisches Schriftzeichen"},{"w":"漢文","r":"かんぶん","m":"klassisches Chinesisch"}]}]